Package: epidemicdates
Title: Impute Missing Symptom Onsets in Line Lists
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Sam", "Abbott", , "sam.abbott@lshtm.ac.uk",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8057-8037"))
Description: Imputes missing symptom onset dates in an epidemic line list
    from report dates. Compares back-sampling from pooled empirical
    onset-to-report delays, a mean shift, a draw from a given forward
    delay and EM back-projection with a given delay, or a static or
    per-period delay estimated in a way that allows for
    right truncation. Also provides double interval censored daily Gamma
    delay distributions and a right truncation correction. The code was
    generated by an LLM and has not been reviewed by a person.
